    → DEFAULT is full-node (per docs validator-installation: validators
      are PROMOTED from a full node after on-chain registration).
    → Snapshot restore is enabled by default (docs step 15: hard-reset).

TWO-PHASE FLOW (default, per docs)
  Phase 1 — install as full-node (sync the chain, build uptime):
    sudo ./monad-validator-setup --network=testnet \
      --triedb-partition=nvme1n1 --start-services
