                        For full-nodes you can use 0x000…000 (burn).
  --node-name=NAME      Unique moniker, displayed in Monad's validator list.

FLAGS (all optional)
  --network=testnet|mainnet         Which Monad network. Asked interactively.
  --full-node                       Full-node template (DEFAULT).
  --validator                       Validator template (use only after on-chain stake).
                                    Without on-chain registration, bootstraps refuse
